      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT to understand the code before improving it.Now I have a clear picture of the original test and CUT. I'll write an improved version with better understandability — cleaner imports, descriptive assertion messages, and a brief comment explaining the intent of each test.Now I'll compile-check the generated test.The improved test compiled successfully (`COMPILE_OK`). The changes made were: removed unused imports (`Jsoup`, `Document`, `HashMap`, `HashSet`), renamed variables to be more descriptive (`scriptLower`/`scriptUpper` instead of `script1`/`script2`), and added inline assertion messages that explain the intent of each check."
